#: ../developer/user-tags.md:1
msgid "User tags and the `unattended` tag"
msgstr "用户标签与 `unattended` 标签"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:3
msgid ""
"A **user tag** names a group of accounts and holds them to limits of its "
"own: a daily and a monthly cost quota, a model allowlist and a cap on "
"concurrent requests. An administrator adds accounts to a tag by hand. A "
"tag can also have an **automatic rule**, which adds every account that "
"sent requests in at least *K* of the last *N* hours."
msgstr ""
"**用户标签**为一组账号命名，并给它们加上标签自己的限制：每日和每月费用配额、模型白名单，以及并发请求上限。管理员可以手动把账号加入标签。标签还可以带一条**自动规则**：在最近"
" *N* 小时中至少有 *K* 个小时发送过请求的账号，都会被自动加入。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:9
msgid ""
"The gateway ships one tag with a rule: **`unattended`**. A person doesn't"
" send requests every hour of a twelve-hour stretch; a script, a cron job "
"or an agent left running does. The tag starts with no limits, so it only "
"labels accounts until an administrator gives it some."
msgstr ""
"网关自带一个带规则的标签：**`unattended`**。真人不会在连续十二个小时里每小时都发送请求，而脚本、cron 任务或无人值守运行的 "
"agent 会。这个标签初始没有任何限制，所以在管理员为它设置限制之前，它只做标记。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:14
msgid ""
"Tags are managed in the admin console under **Users → User tags**, or "
"through the admin API below."
msgstr "标签在管理控制台的 **Users → User tags** 中管理，也可以通过下面的管理 API 管理。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:17
msgid "What a tag's limits mean"
msgstr "标签限制的含义"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:19
msgid ""
"Each limit on a tag is a **ceiling**. A member is held to the strictest "
"of its own limit and the limits of every tag it carries:"
msgstr "标签上的每项限制都是一个**上限**。成员受自身限制与其所有标签限制中最严格的那一项约束："

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Combines as"
msgstr "合并方式"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Daily cost quota"
msgstr "每日费用配额"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The lowest of the account's own and each tag's. An account with no daily "
"quota of its own counts as the 1000 USD default."
msgstr "取账号自身配额与各标签配额中的最小值。账号自身没有每日配额时，按默认的 1000 USD 计。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Monthly cost quota"
msgstr "每月费用配额"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "The lowest of the account's own (none means no limit) and each tag's."
msgstr "取账号自身配额（没有即不限）与各标签配额中的最小值。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Concurrent requests"
msgstr "并发请求"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The lowest of the account's cap (its own override, else its role's) and "
"each tag's. The tag cap also limits an unlimited role, and applies to the"
" concurrency-exempt and token-counting budgets too."
msgstr ""
"取账号上限（有单独覆盖值时用它，否则用其角色的上限）与各标签上限中的最小值。标签上限对不限并发的角色同样生效，也适用于免并发限制模型和 token"
" 计数各自的预算。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The member may use only models on **every** tag's allowlist, on top of "
"the role, disabled-model, key and project checks. A tag without an "
"allowlist doesn't restrict models. Allowlists that share no model allow "
"none."
msgstr ""
"成员只能使用出现在**每一个**标签白名单中的模型，此外仍要通过角色、禁用模型、key "
"和项目的检查。没有白名单的标签不限制模型。几个白名单没有共同的模型时，任何模型都不允许。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:29
msgid ""
"So a tag can only narrow what an account may do. An automatic tag can't "
"loosen a limit an administrator set on the account, and two tags never "
"conflict over which one wins. To give a group *more* than its accounts "
"have, raise the accounts' own limits."
msgstr "因此，标签只会收窄账号能做的事。自动标签无法放宽管理员给账号设置的限制，两个标签之间也不会出现谁优先的冲突。要给一组账号*更多*额度，请提高这些账号自身的限制。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:34
msgid ""
"The limits apply on every way in: an API key, an inference grant from the"
" cloud agent, a request made on a user's behalf (`X-On-Behalf-Of`) and "
"the console playground. Batch work is held to a tag's quotas and "
"allowlist; its concurrency is the batch scheduler's own per-role limit, "
"which ignores per-account caps too. The model listings (`/v1/models`) and"
" the console's model pickers leave out models a tag doesn't allow. `GET "
"/v1/key` and the usage dashboard report the concurrency cap the tags "
"impose."
msgstr ""
"这些限制对所有入口都生效：API key、云端 agent 的推理 grant、代表用户发起的请求（`X-On-Behalf-Of`）以及控制台的"
" "
"Playground。批量任务受标签的配额和白名单约束；它的并发由批量调度器按角色设定的上限决定，这个上限同样不看账号单独设置的上限。模型列表（`/v1/models`）和控制台的模型选择器会去掉标签不允许的模型。`GET"
" /v1/key` 和用量面板会报告标签施加的并发上限。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:42
msgid ""
"A change to a tag's limits applies to its members on their next request "
"in the process that made it, and in other gateway processes within 30 "
"seconds (their cached auth lookups expire)."
msgstr "修改标签的限制后，在做出修改的进程中，成员的下一个请求就会按新限制处理；其他网关进程会在 30 秒内跟上（它们缓存的认证查询到期）。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:46
msgid ""
"Amounts are in the ledger currency ([Accounting](accounting.md)). A write"
" that sets an amount names the currency it was read in, and is refused "
"(409) if the ledger's currency has changed since."
msgstr "金额以账本币种计（[记账](accounting.md)）。设置金额的写入要注明读取时的币种；如果账本币种在此之后变了，写入会被拒绝（409）。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:50
msgid "The automatic rule"
msgstr "自动规则"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:52
msgid ""
"A tag's rule has a window of *N* hours (1–168) and a threshold of *K* "
"active hours (1–*N*). Every ten minutes, a scheduled job counts, for each"
" account, the distinct hours among the last *N* in which it sent at least"
" one request. It counts rolling hours back from now, not clock hours. The"
" job gives the tag to every active account with at least *K* such hours."
msgstr ""
"标签的规则有一个 *N* 小时的窗口（1–168）和一个 *K* 个活跃小时的阈值（1–*N*）。一个定时任务每十分钟为每个账号统计：在最近 "
"*N* 小时中，有多少个不同的小时里它至少发送过一个请求。统计按从现在往前滚动的小时计，而不是按整点。任务把标签给所有至少有 *K* "
"个这样小时的活跃账号。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:58
msgid ""
"A request is a row of `api_logs` attributed to the account. Rows written "
"by a batch job are left out: the gateway sends batch requests at its own "
"pace, whoever is watching."
msgstr "一个请求就是 `api_logs` 中归属于该账号的一行。批量任务写入的行不计入：批量请求由网关按自己的节奏发送，与有没有人值守无关。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:61
msgid ""
"`unattended` defaults to *every one of the last 12 hours* (12 of 12). Use"
" *Preview matches* in the editor to see who a different rule would match "
"before saving it. For example, *20 of 24* catches fewer heavy human "
"users, and *1 of 6* tags anyone active in the last six hours."
msgstr ""
"`unattended` 默认要求*最近 12 小时中的每一个小时*（12 中取 12）。保存前可以在编辑器中用 *Preview "
"matches* 查看另一条规则会匹配哪些账号。例如，*24 中取 20* 会少误伤一些重度使用的真人，*6 中取 1* "
"会给最近六小时内活跃过的所有账号打上标签。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:65
msgid ""
"One run happens at a time across all replicas: the job holds a PostgreSQL"
" advisory lock, and a replica that can't take it skips its turn. **Run "
"rule now** in the console runs a tag's rule immediately."
msgstr ""
"所有副本中同一时间只有一次运行：任务持有一个 PostgreSQL advisory lock，拿不到锁的副本跳过这一轮。控制台中的 **Run "
"rule now** 会立即运行一个标签的规则。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:69
msgid "An automatic tag stays until an administrator removes it"
msgstr "自动标签会一直保留，直到管理员移除"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:71
msgid ""
"The rule only adds members. If it also removed them, a quota or allowlist"
" on the tag would undo itself: requests refused by the tag's own limits "
"aren't logged, so an account the tag stopped would soon stop matching, "
"lose the tag and its limits, and start again."
msgstr "规则只添加成员。如果它也移除成员，标签上的配额或白名单就会自我失效：被标签自身限制拒绝的请求不会写入日志，所以被标签拦下的账号很快就不再匹配规则，从而失去标签和它的限制，然后又重新开始。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:76
msgid ""
"When you remove a tag that has a rule, the membership is kept as "
"**dismissed**. A dismissed membership applies no limits. The rule gives "
"the tag back only if the account's requests *since the dismissal* match "
"it again, so a false positive stays off unless the behaviour starts "
"again. Removing the dismissed marker as well (the × on a struck-through "
"tag) forgets the dismissal. Adding the tag by hand turns any membership "
"into a manual one."
msgstr ""
"移除一个带规则的标签时，这条成员关系会保留为 "
"**dismissed**（已撤销）。已撤销的成员关系不施加任何限制。只有账号在*撤销之后*的请求再次匹配规则时，规则才会把标签加回来，所以误判的账号不会被重新打上标签，除非这种行为再次出现。再移除这个撤销标记（带删除线标签上的"
" ×）会忘掉这次撤销。手动添加标签会把任何成员关系变成手动的。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:83
msgid "Admin API"
msgstr "管理 API"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:85
msgid ""
"All endpoints require admin authentication (a console session or "
"`ADMIN_TOKEN`). Every write is recorded in the audit log under a "
"`user_tag.*` action."
msgstr "所有端点都需要管理员认证（控制台会话或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`）。每次写入都会以 `user_tag.*` 操作记入审计日志。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Method and path"
msgstr "方法与路径"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "`GET /admin/user-tags`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/user-tags`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Every tag with its limits, rule and member counts, built-in tags first."
msgstr "所有标签及其限制、规则和成员数，内置标签排在前面。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "`POST /admin/user-tags`"
msgstr "`POST /admin/user-tags`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Create a tag: `name` (lowercase letters, digits, `-`, `_`; at most 32), "
"`description`, the limits and the rule."
msgstr "创建标签：`name`（小写字母、数字、`-`、`_`；最多 32 个字符）、`description`、各项限制和规则。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`PATCH /admin/user-tags/{name}`"
msgstr "`PATCH /admin/user-tags/{name}`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Change only the fields sent. `null` clears a limit."
msgstr "只修改请求中给出的字段。`null` 清除一项限制。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}`"
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Delete a tag and its memberships. The built-in tag can't be deleted "
"(409); turn its rule off instead."
msgstr "删除标签及其所有成员关系。内置标签不能删除（409），可以改为关闭它的规则。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The tag's memberships, applied ones first; `source` (repeatable) filters "
"by `manual`, `auto` or `dismissed`."
msgstr "标签的成员关系，生效中的排在前面；`source`（可重复）按 `manual`、`auto` 或 `dismissed` 筛选。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"
msgstr "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/members`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add accounts by hand: `{\"user_ids\": [...]}`. Unknown ids are reported, "
"not refused."
msgstr "手动添加账号：`{\"user_ids\": [...]}`。未知的 id 会在结果中列出，不会导致请求被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}/members/{user_id}`"
msgstr "`DELETE /admin/user-tags/{name}/members/{user_id}`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"Remove the tag from an account; under a rule, the membership is kept as "
"dismissed."
msgstr "从账号移除标签；标签带规则时，这条成员关系保留为已撤销。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/preview`"
msgstr "`GET /admin/user-tags/{name}/preview`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid ""
"The accounts a rule matches now, read only. Optional `window_hours` / "
"`min_active_hours` try bounds that aren't saved yet."
msgstr "规则当前匹配的账号，只读。可选的 `window_hours` / `min_active_hours` 用来试用尚未保存的参数。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/detect`"
msgstr "`POST /admin/user-tags/{name}/detect`"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md
msgid "Run a tag's rule now (409 when the rule is off)."
msgstr "立即运行标签的规则（规则关闭时返回 409）。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:101
msgid ""
"The tag fields are `quota_daily_cost`, `quota_monthly_cost` (with "
"`currency`), `max_concurrent_requests`, `allowed_models` (canonical model"
" ids; an alias is stored as its model), `auto_enabled`, "
"`auto_window_hours` and `auto_min_active_hours`."
msgstr ""
"标签的字段有 `quota_daily_cost`、`quota_monthly_cost`（与 `currency` "
"一起提交）、`max_concurrent_requests`、`allowed_models`（规范模型 "
"id；别名会存为它所指向的模型）、`auto_enabled`、`auto_window_hours` 和 "
"`auto_min_active_hours`。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /admin/users` accepts `tag=<name>` to list only the users a tag "
"applies to, and each user carries `tags`. `GET /admin/users/{id}/detail` "
"returns the account's `tag_memberships` (dismissed ones included) and "
"`tag_limits`, the combined limits of its applied tags."
msgstr ""
"`GET /admin/users` 接受 `tag=<name>`，只列出该标签作用的用户，每个用户都带有 `tags`。`GET "
"/admin/users/{id}/detail` 返回账号的 `tag_memberships`（含已撤销的）和 "
"`tag_limits`，即其生效标签合并后的限制。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:111
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:113
msgid "Migration `0023_user_tags` adds two tables and seeds `unattended`:"
msgstr "迁移 `0023_user_tags` 新增两张表，并预置 `unattended`："

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:115
msgid ""
"`user_tags`: one row per tag with its limits (`NULL` sets none) and rule;"
" `system` marks a built-in tag."
msgstr "`user_tags`：每个标签一行，包含它的限制（`NULL` 表示不设）和规则；`system` 标记内置标签。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:117
msgid ""
"`user_tag_members`: `(user_id, tag)` with `source` (`manual`, `auto` or "
"`dismissed`), `assigned_at` and `assigned_by` (the administrator's user "
"id; `NULL` for the rule). A membership is deleted with its account or its"
" tag."
msgstr ""
"`user_tag_members`：`(user_id, tag)`，以及 `source`（`manual`、`auto` 或 "
"`dismissed`）、`assigned_at` 和 `assigned_by`（管理员的用户 id；由规则添加时为 "
"`NULL`）。账号或标签被删除时，相应的成员关系随之删除。"

#: ../developer/user-tags.md:121
msgid ""
"The auth lookups join an account's applied tags in the same query and "
"fold their limits into the row "
"([`serving.user_tags`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/apps/backend/serving/user_tags.py))."
" For an account without tags this costs one primary-key probe."
msgstr ""
"认证查询在同一条 SQL "
"中关联账号的生效标签，并把它们的限制合并进结果行（[`serving.user_tags`](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/apps/backend/serving/user_tags.py)）。对没有标签的账号，代价是一次主键探查。"
